config BR2_PACKAGE_COSMIC_SOUND_THEME
	bool "cosmic-sound-theme"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SOUND_THEME_FREEDESKTOP
	help
	  System76's COSMIC sound theme (notifications, alerts,
	  battery, screen lock). Also answers COSMIC's hardcoded
	  "Pop" theme lookups; the freedesktop theme covers the ones
	  COSMIC makes under "freedesktop" (volume change, plug).

	  https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-sound-theme
